# Derived by hand from Type System ch. 2 (an element value is placed by `@Element`), Semantics ch. 8 (the statement's place is the block's next position) and ch. 9 (the World's first value at the build, each push in the tick it comes): the gauge is 0, the label 1. Never run: prismc refuses the program.
test a_placed_dynamic_element

